        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ghwajoar sugoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh sugoodiga ng'eanyiida ghayi joar fuga Israeli gil, ak goombal ng'eanyiida mida giigheawda Yordani bea heeda ghayeawa, ghang'eada moangoachiyda Armoni ea ghwahita Giijeeda Hermoni, ea ng'eanyiisean mida gayeewda Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea Sihoni was sugoocheanda fuga Amori mida Heshboni, ambal gidang'eada Arnoni, ea ghang'eada ng'eanyiida mida bugusta moangoachi ea ghwahita eenda Yaboki, ea moonghooda fuga Amoni, ea googween Gileyadi iyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ng'eanyiida Araba ea ghwahita basooda Gineroti mida heeda ghayeawa, sigal Bet-yeshimoti, ea ghwahita basooda Araba, ea basooda Balang'da mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, bea rarang'eadayda Bisga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Ogu was sugoocheanda Bashani, ghayi was boosteanga fuga Refayimu, mida Ashtaroti ea Edreyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak goombal Giijeeda Hermoni ea Saleka ea Bashaneesean ea ghwahita moonghooda ng'eanyiida Geshuri ea Makati, ea googween iyeenya Gileyadi ea ghwahita moonghooda Sihoni was sugoocheanda Heshboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa, siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea fuga Israeli ghabwar saawa; ak Musa siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ghoadaw ng'eanyiida nyaawa goombal fuga Rubeni ea Gadi ea eemeeda silach bugusta bea Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa ghwajoar sugoodiga",
